      "id": 1,
      "text": "City Island’s first rail link was a narrow‑gauge horsecar line built by the Pelham Park Railroad Company, running from the Harlem River station to Brown’s Hotel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
